  "rtfx" : 2.076841893753884,
  "segments" : [
    {
      "end" : 157.52000427246094,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 150.1999969482422,
      "text" : "What needs need to be fulfilled by the product, what effect the product has to have and how it's"
    },
    {
      "end" : 183.10000610351562,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 180.02000427246094,
      "text" : "and so what's the characteristics of that animal?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 358.08001708984375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 356.260009765625,
      "text" : "Please leave me a place at the bottom."
    },
    {
      "end" : 382.4200134277344,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 380.7200012207031,
      "text" : "It was originally going to be."
    },
    {
      "end" : 383.58001708984375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 382.7400207519531,
      "text" : "That looks like a beak."
    },
    {
      "end" : 396.82000732421875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 395.8700256347656,
      "text" : "It can be a crocodile."
    },
    {
      "end" : 401.52001953125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 399.3600158691406,
      "text" : "Firstly it was an attempt at a T-Rex."
    },
    {
      "end" : 405.29998779296875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 402.0199890136719,
      "text" : "and then it sort of changed into a pelican but it can be perfect."
    },
    {
      "end" : 424.1000061035156,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 421.20001220703125,
      "text" : "Yeah and I'll have to think on the spot one time."
    },
    {
      "end" : 489.8599853515625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 488.4800109863281,
      "text" : "It's not that bad, honestly!"
    },
    {
      "end" : 524.0599975585938,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 520.47998046875,
      "text" : "Independent. Independent. Did you say they're good at golf?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 524.4400024414062,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 524.3400268554688,
      "text" : "Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "end" : 525.7000122070312,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 525.3599853515625,
      "text" : "Ego."
    },
    {
      "end" : 530.5800170898438,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 526.739990234375,
      "text" : "Alright. They're quite free-spirited."
    },
    {
      "end" : 591.4000244140625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 591.02001953125,
      "text" : "I'd think so."
    },
    {
      "end" : 599.5999755859375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 595.239990234375,
      "text" : "Having said they, if you want to get one of those, they're the ones on the market at the moment."
    },
    {
      "end" : 654.5399780273438,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 652.52001953125,
      "text" : "Big target group. Yes."
    },
    {
      "end" : 661.2000122070312,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 655,
      "text" : "I don't think it's a case of worrying about different languages and things like that."
    },
    {
      "end" : 752.9000244140625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 750.8599853515625,
      "text" : "And it's the symbols that you don't necessarily understand"
    },
    {
      "end" : 863.9000244140625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 863.3800048828125,
      "text" : "I"
    },
    {
      "end" : 871.4400024414062,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 863.9000244140625,
      "text" : "don't know how. I don't like the new phones that kind of got a Windows based running system."
    },
    {
      "end" : 884.97998046875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 872.8699951171875,
      "text" : "I find it really confusng. I kept getting lost in the phone. I had not got any experience"
    },
    {
      "end" : 922.1199951171875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 913.5800170898438,
      "text" : "What about a dual function in that you've got the basic buttons just for your play, volume, programs?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 971.260009765625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 970.6600341796875,
      "text" : "- No, no, no!"
    },
    {
      "end" : 976.0400390625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 973.6799926757812,
      "text" : "- Right, okay, we've got half an hour before the next meeting"
    },
    {
      "end" : 982.6799926757812,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 980.8800048828125,
      "text" : "I think that's probably about it"
    },
    {
      "end" : 986.780029296875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 985.6400146484375,
      "text" : "and I get to do another."
    },
    {
      "end" : 996.3199462890625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 989.0399780273438,
      "text" : "Just a quick thing about the, what you were saying about the, doesn't need to be fashionable,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 995.6799926757812,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 993.1400146484375,
      "text" : "Subtitles by the Amara.org community"
    },
    {
      "end" : 1003.5799560546875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 996.5899658203125,
      "text" : "the, so I had a quick look at the company website and it's like the, we put the fashion"
    },
    {
      "end" : 1009.0599975585938,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 1003.7999877929688,
      "text" : "into electronics, so I thought the whole design thing might be fun."
    }
  ],
